    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>魔药配方</>\n晋升至更高序列的必须品，包含主材料和辅助材料。集齐下一序列的魔药配方中的所有魔药材料后，才能进行制作对应序列的魔药，完成晋升。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>魔药材料获取</>\n到达相应的消化进度之后，非凡者将获得灵性指引，引导其完成相应的任务，获得魔药材料。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Potion Formulas</>\nEssential items for advancing to a higher Sequence, containing main ingredients and auxiliary ingredients. Only after collecting all the potion materials in the next Sequence's potion formula can you craft the corresponding Sequence potion and complete the advancement.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Obtaining Potion Materials</>\nUpon reaching the corresponding digestion progress, Beyonders will receive spiritual guidance, leading them to complete the corresponding quests and obtain potion materials.",
    ["C级占位"] = "C-Grade Placeholder",
