    ["你在命运咖啡厅被“正义”小姐唤醒，看到窗外城市的生活图景，获知“愚者”先生的尊名后，踏入现实中的廷根市，苏茜将“正义”小姐馈赠的零花钱送给你。你通过汤姆购买报纸，了解时事，在“魔术师”女士帮助下开启旅行尖碑，但在追踪梦中男子时，遭遇邪神信徒围攻。幸好“星星”先生及时救场，并将一枚源于“愚者”先生的金币送给你。你们回到黑荆棘安保公司，在罗珊协助下，你签署合同成为正式员工，获赠入职大礼包，并拥有一辆脚踏车。"] = "You are awakened by Miss \"Justice\" at the Fate Café, see the life scenes of the city outside the window, and after learning the honorific name of Mr. Fool, you step into the real Tingen City, where Xio sends you the pocket money gifted by Miss \"Justice.\" You buy a newspaper through Tom to learn about current events, and with the help of Miss \"Magician,\" you open the travel stele, but while tracking the man from your dream, you are besieged by followers of the evil god. Fortunately, Mr. \"Star\" saves the day and gives you a gold coin originating from Mr. Fool. You return to Blackthorn Security Company, and with Rozanne's assistance, you sign a contract to become a formal employee, receive an onboarding gift package, and get a bicycle.",
