    ["有太多非凡者因为缺乏扮演的机会而消化缓慢，更有甚者陷入混乱，我们成立“魔钥学会”就是为了解决这一问题。"] = "There are too many Beyonders whose digestion is slow due to a lack of opportunities to act, and even worse, some fall into chaos. We established the 'Potion Key Society' to solve this problem.",
