    ["甜冰茶小猫(已废弃）"] = "Sweet Iced Tea Kitten (Deprecated)",
    ["皮特摸摸祭台旁边的月亮木偶，点亮第三根蜡烛。\n伊妮德突兀地出现，从林间跑出来。\n伊妮德：哥哥，原来你在这。\n皮特：伊妮德，快过来，到哥哥身边来。\n伊妮德刚踏入法阵区域，法阵完全亮起。"] = "Pete touched the moon puppet next to the altar and lit the third candle. \n Enid appeared abruptly, running out from the woods. \n Enid: Brother, so you were here. \n Pete: Enid, come here, come to your brother's side. \n Just as Enid stepped into the magic circle area, the circle lit up completely.",
    ["真是可惜，这家餐馆是我和奥杰里克先生友谊的见证，我们就是在一张餐桌上认识的！"] = "It's a pity; this restaurant is a testament to the friendship between Mr. Ojerik and me. We met at a dining table!",
    ["神秘男子朝绯红意志扔出一枚金币，而金币逐渐蔓延出灰雾。\n这些灰雾包裹住绯红意志，成功地封印了它。"] = "The mysterious man threw a gold coin at the Crimson Will, and the gold coin gradually spread gray fog. \n This gray fog enveloped the Crimson Will, successfully sealing it.",
